    "description": "The Room Availability Management API facilitates businesses in checking and managing the availability of hotel rooms. This API allows users to submit requests to determine room availability based on specific criteria such as dates and room types. Ideal for travel agencies and booking platforms, it integrates seamlessly into reservation systems, providing real-time data to improve user experiences. By leveraging this API, businesses can ensure accurate availability updates helping to optimize bookings and enhance customer satisfaction.",
